#### execute-top-level — the v2 case execute-layout/execute-top-level, as a pull writes it
=== text
%LANGUAGE LD
%NETWORK
%EXECUTE
x := 1;
%END_EXECUTE
=== model
NETWORK
  (EXECUTE "x := 1;")

#### execute-enabled — the v2 case execute-layout/execute-enabled, as a pull writes it
=== text
